  "title": "Crispy Pork Carnitas",
  "description": "This carnitas recipe is Chef John&#39;s method for slow-roasting pork in lard, citrus, garlic, and fragrant spices until tender inside and crisp outside.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
